The Payload shall be designed and qualified to the environmental conditions summarized in Table 6-1. Qualification
testing shall follow the procedures of MIL-STD-810H and RTCA DO-160G as indicated. The contractor shall submit a
detailed Environmental Qualification Test Plan (EQTP) for Government approval not later than 60 days after contract
award.
temperature-altitude-humidity test profile representative of a 30-hour mission at 55 000 ft followed by rapid descent to
sea-level tropical conditions. The profile shall be agreed with the Government and documented in the EQTP.
