3. REQUIREMENTS
3.1 System Performance Requirements.
The Payload shall meet or exceed the performance values listed in Table 3-1 under the environmental conditions
defined in Section 3.5. All optical performance values are specified at the sensor aperture and include the effects of the
protective window and any internal relay optics.
Table 3-1. Key Performance Parameters
