This document establishes the technical requirements, interface definitions, performance parameters, environmental
qualification criteria, and logistics support data for the Multi-Band EO/IR Sensor Payload Suite intended for integration
on High-Altitude Long-Endurance (HALE) unmanned aerial systems supporting persistent border surveillance
missions.
